# Third-party notices: make_app_archive.py concatenates the license files listed here into the
# NOTICES.txt shipped in every app archive. One upstream per line:
#
#     <name> | <path of its license file>
#
# @BUILD@ is the CMake build tree (the FetchContent checkouts live in @BUILD@/_deps/<name>-src;
# by default the parent of the stage directory) and @SRC@ is native/ (the vendored copies in
# node/third_party). A listed file that does not exist fails the archive step on purpose: a
# notice that silently went missing is a license violation nobody would see.
#
# Add a line here whenever a new upstream is linked into, or shipped beside, libsokuji_native.
ggml             | @BUILD@/_deps/ggml-src/LICENSE
llama.cpp        | @BUILD@/_deps/llama-src/LICENSE
transcribe.cpp   | @BUILD@/_deps/transcribe-src/LICENSE
audio.cpp        | @BUILD@/_deps/audiocpp-src/LICENSE
# Statically linked into libsokuji_native by the engines above (vendored in their trees):
miniz            | @BUILD@/_deps/transcribe-src/src/third_party/miniz/LICENSE
cJSON            | @BUILD@/_deps/audiocpp-src/external/cJSON/LICENSE
libyaml          | @BUILD@/_deps/audiocpp-src/external/libyaml/License
sentencepiece    | @BUILD@/_deps/audiocpp-src/external/sentencepiece/LICENSE
node-addon-api   | @SRC@/node/third_party/node-addon-api/LICENSE.md
node-api-headers | @SRC@/node/third_party/node-api-headers/LICENSE
SpeexDSP         | @SRC@/node/third_party/speexdsp/COPYING
node-gyp win_delay_load_hook (Windows addon only) | @SRC@/node/third_party/win_delay_load_hook.LICENSE
